{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">世界最醜樣狗狗大賽在美國加州舉行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">由這隻舌頭經常垂下的6歲八哥勝出，主人獲得五千美元，折合約3.9萬港元的獎金。這隻八哥在韓國一間工廠被救出，四年前被美國的主人領養，去年參賽獲得亞軍，今年再度登台終於奪冠。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.DOG-2300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026uSRd9Wsd0g1786886138.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.DOG-2300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.US.DOG-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026a3v1lIWKSs1786884610.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.US.DOG-2300_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">這項比賽已有逾五十歷史，主辦單位希望傳達狗的價值，不能單憑外表，以及呼籲民眾關注和領養流浪動物。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-16T13:19:02.147425+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}